{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "HELIOS versioned read API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "First read slice; legacy write APIs retain known project authorization limitations. All protected routes require active tenant membership. Directors see their tenant, master/PTO need active project membership, workers additionally need own active employee assignment for projects/tasks. Own employee profile may be read without assignment. Details hide inaccessible rows with 404. Counts use authorized rows. Overview uses civil day in tenant timezone with half-open timestamp bounds. reviewedReportsForDay means accepted_quantity IS NOT NULL, including zero, not completed tasks. currentOpenShifts is current across days. Null acceptedQuantity means no report in the group has been reviewed. No mixed-unit sum. Unavailable metrics are intentional capability declarations."
  },
